1
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,140
What in the world is going on?

2
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:29,517
and one person With the
tears of tears I'm going to

3
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:39,800
to

4
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:46,710
cry

5
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:49,120
I've seen my dreams

6
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,800
And it's worth it.

7
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,259
And it's worth it.

8
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:04,280
This is the chance to see
you, That time you had me.

9
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,737
I'm going to say I are?

10
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:09,357
It's a time to go and start.

11
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:12,137
It's a time to go and start.

12
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:16,737
I will always go and start.

13
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:18,817
I will always say this world!

14
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:20,860
Let's go to the sky.

15
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,860
Let's go!

16
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,310
blossoms.

17
00:01:50,393 --> 00:01:54,740
I love breathing in the fragrance,
the fresh green leaves as I ran.

18
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,830
I thought

19
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:04,897
we would always live our whole
lives with nature at our fingertips.

20
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,360
But I was wrong.

21
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:22,700
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

22
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:51,180
Back off!

23
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,940
With me, Yuki!

24
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:04,709
Our objective is complete.

25
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:06,491
We should leave, Shikoku.

26
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:09,297
Why don't you head back
without me, Jouryuu?

27
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:11,617
I'm going to stay here and watch a while.

28
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:14,437
That other Shuki is pretty
strong, don't you think?

29
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,677
I want to see how this all plays out.

30
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,701
All right, then.

31
00:03:20,100 --> 00:03:21,020
Make it quick.

32
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,350
Focus.

33
00:03:33,540 --> 00:03:34,370
Focus.

34
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:51,687
I learned how to step up my game
during our training sessions.

35
00:03:54,940 --> 00:03:57,520
And I have something worth fighting for!

36
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,200
It won't stop!

37
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:35,130
Miss Kyoka!

38
00:04:35,213 --> 00:04:36,060
Here it comes!

39
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:57,940
I could even channel my
strength into my mouth!

40
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,720
Talk about dangerous!

41
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:03,392
I kind of like this guy!

42
00:05:18,020 --> 00:05:20,640
I can see that you're extremely angry.

43
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:21,820
That's too bad.

44
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:25,220
Because my rage burns
a hundred times water!

45
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:35,050
Medjugorje!

46
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,760
This is where you perish.

47
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:45,920
The technique I learned
to carve you into pieces!

48
00:05:52,740 --> 00:05:54,500
Howling cherry blossom!

49
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,960
No countering or dodging me this time!

50
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,800
With the unyielding king of my blade!

51
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,880
You will die!

52
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,940
The time has finally come!

53
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:12,700
Top bow down!

54
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:27,220
Miss Kyoka...

55
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,760
Kyoka...

56
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,340
She's gone.

57
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:40,157
Go gather up the others.

58
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,320
Got it!

59
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,120
This victory...

60
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:56,220
...is for my hometown.

61
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,357
That was quite the spectacular battle.

62
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:16,146
The commander of the seventh
squadron is pretty impressive too.

63
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:23,000
But more importantly that man
I find him quite interesting.

64
00:07:31,540 --> 00:07:33,497
Big sis are you hurt?

65
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:36,960
Just a few scratches I'll heal quickly.

66
00:07:39,940 --> 00:07:44,357
Miss Tenka hey everyone you didn't
have to come back right away.

67
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:47,837
This is a family issue
so I had to be here.

68
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:50,257
You don't have to worry about the others.

69
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:53,277
Ney's doing a great job
handling the situation.

70
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:56,697
So what are you going to do now?

71
00:07:56,780 --> 00:08:01,220
I can't say I feel like leading a revolt.

72
00:08:01,900 --> 00:08:03,657
The Shuki we rallied are gone.

73
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:05,880
Plus, they abducted Kokonan.

74
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,760
But I still have to save them.

75
00:08:09,140 --> 00:08:11,375
Are you willing to let me protect you?

76
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:17,008
If you don't plan on causing trouble,
there's no need for us to keep fighting.

77
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:19,340
You're a victim of a Mato mishap.

78
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:22,504
I'll do everything I can
to rescue your friends.

79
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:23,960
Same for me.

80
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,673
I want to help you too.

81
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:29,260
We won't let the Onmyo
Bureau touch you either.

82
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:30,380
Big Sis?

83
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:39,920
I trust Tenka and Kyoka, but I can't
trust the organization as a whole But why?

84
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:43,057
You can't stay here anymore
We've got other villages,

85
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:45,434
and my friends are already on the move.

86
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,980
It's my job to look after them.

87
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,944
If they have somewhere to hide,

88
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:55,357
then choosing not to accept our
offer would be a sensible decision?

89
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,270
What?

90
00:08:56,860 --> 00:09:01,940
Supreme Commander Yamashiro, if the Onmyo
Bureau is conducting these experiments,

91
00:09:02,340 --> 00:09:05,399
there is a decent chance
she is already aware of it.

92
00:09:06,100 --> 00:09:10,340
The Supreme Commander of
the Demon Defense Force.

93
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:12,211
But why does that matter?

94
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:16,640
It's reassuring to have a Supreme
Commander who's so patriotic,

95
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,506
but she's a little unnerving.

96
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:21,837
I couldn't bring myself to
attack Alba during our fight,

97
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:25,620
but the Supreme Commander
wouldn't have hesitated.

98
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:29,037
Whether something's right
or wrong, it doesn't matter.

99
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,473
That's just how she is.

100
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:35,261
Which is why hiding might actually
be a safer option at the moment.

101
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:38,820
Luckily, our conversations
haven't left this cave.

102
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:41,800
And we can investigate the Onyo Bureau.

103
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:46,200
Then how long will my sister
and her friends have to hide?

104
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:47,800
That's an easy one.

105
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,880
You made it back home.

106
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:13,335
I'm glad you're okay.

107
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:15,717
Sorry for making you worry.

108
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,800
I owe everyone else for saving me.

109
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:19,957
How are Himari and the others?

110
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:23,457
They'll be clear to come back after
two or three days of bed rest.

111
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:24,370
Good to hear.

112
00:10:24,453 --> 00:10:27,262
Then I'm off to get my
entries looked at as well.

113
00:10:27,540 --> 00:10:30,877
I'll check on Himari and the
others while I'm in the area.

114
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:31,790
Thanks.

115
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:36,200
Miss Tenka! Huh?

116
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:38,057
I, uh...

117
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:42,760
The next time we're alone, I
expect a very generous reward.

118
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:48,255
I'll catch you later.

119
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:55,697
Nei has to go drop off a
change of clothes for Ms.

120
00:10:55,780 --> 00:10:56,610
Himari and Ms.

121
00:10:56,693 --> 00:11:01,960
Shushu Please feel free to unwind in
the bath I think I'll do just that Yuki,

122
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:06,360
stand by in your slave form Come get
me at the first sign of an attack

123
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:11,700
Yes, ma 'am You must be hungry by
now Are you up to eating some dinner?

124
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,440
Uh, sure

125
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:17,217
Are you okay?

126
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:20,760
Are you in any pain no, I'm fine

127
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:26,297
It's just the others are the demon
defense force has a talented medical team.

128
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:28,204
They'll bounce back soon enough

129
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:30,760
Yeah, that's what Miss Kyoka said.

130
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,060
If something happens,

131
00:11:35,180 --> 00:11:39,709
it's your job to work extra hard on
behalf of everyone who's in the hospital!

132
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:45,420
So eat something when you
can and try to cheer up.

133
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:47,520
Senpai's orders.

134
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:49,680
You got it. Thanks.

135
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:53,860
It's okay.

136
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:55,497
I'll go grab you some food.

137
00:11:55,580 --> 00:11:58,820
Oh, take your time and
be careful. Don't worry.

138
00:11:59,060 --> 00:12:00,820
I'm your senpai, remember?

139
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:12,260
I'm disengaging my ability.

140
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:13,730
Okay.

141
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:22,660
Go rinse off in the shower
before your reward begins. What?

142
00:12:23,420 --> 00:12:26,320
Once you're finished, meet me in my room.

143
00:12:26,660 --> 00:12:27,697
Be quick about it.

144
00:12:27,780 --> 00:12:28,610
Right.

145
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:34,360
What is this?

146
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:55,497
Apparently, your reward is
sleeping in my bed with me.

147
00:12:55,580 --> 00:12:56,980
Oh, all righty then.

148
00:12:57,380 --> 00:13:02,220
I know that rest is important,
but lack of clothing is dumb.

149
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:19,380
You're such a pervert.

150
00:13:20,060 --> 00:13:21,220
Sorry about that.

151
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:25,217
You'll be exhausted if you don't get
some sleep, and the reward won't end.

152
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:26,740
I feel wide awake.

153
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:28,650
Really?

154
00:13:29,220 --> 00:13:30,050
Huh?

155
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:33,537
In that case, perhaps we
should do something else.

156
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:34,450
Huh?

157
00:13:34,533 --> 00:13:37,120
Wait! Sit still! Trust me on this!

158
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:41,857
The price of my ability only
lets me move so far, but...

159
00:13:41,940 --> 00:13:44,057
What exactly is the point of this again?

160
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:47,560
To make sure you understand
that I am your master!

161
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,077
Yes, yes, I am fully aware of that fact!

162
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:51,866
Except you ignored my orders!

163
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:55,432
Then obeyed your sister instead
and got yourself captured!

164
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:59,000
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to!

165
00:13:59,540 --> 00:14:02,217
It was just a knee-jerk
reaction, it's an old habit!

166
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:03,200
I surrender!

167
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:07,617
You said your sister always used
to put you in a headlock rack!

168
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:12,197
You'll need extensive disciplining, but
I'll start with the same method she used!

169
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:16,120
The fact that I'm okay with
this is a little concerning.

170
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,460
I swear.

171
00:14:24,180 --> 00:14:25,880
Now you get some rest.

172
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:37,360
Why did you bring two of them here?

173
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,780
For insurance.

174
00:14:39,340 --> 00:14:42,497
For when the time comes that it
decides to be picky about its food.

175
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,300
You spoil that damn thing.

176
00:14:45,380 --> 00:14:47,720
Then again, it does need food to grow.

177
00:14:48,180 --> 00:14:50,620
It's the only god that ever has.

178
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:54,224
That just means it's going
to be a powerful one.

179
00:14:55,060 --> 00:14:55,960
Hear that?

180
00:14:56,260 --> 00:14:58,436
You get to live forever inside a god.

181
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:03,280
This seems promising.

182
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:04,780
Our newest friend.

183
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:07,740
And look, she's about to be born.

184
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:09,610
Hm?

185
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,670
Ah!

186
00:15:12,753 --> 00:15:13,583
A whole feast!

187
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:16,617
To celebrate your return and as
a way of showing my gratitude,

188
00:15:16,700 --> 00:15:18,347
we pulled out all the stops!

189
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:20,820
So this is one of Yuki's famous meals.

190
00:15:21,100 --> 00:15:22,960
It looks and smells delicious!

191
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:26,177
We'll make ramen with the leftover broth!

192
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:27,120
Yes, please!

193
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:30,497
I can't believe you have an
appetite for something so low-brow!

194
00:15:30,580 --> 00:15:32,537
Well, you're welcome to
not eat it, Yachi-ho.

195
00:15:32,620 --> 00:15:33,450
Oh no,

196
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:38,237
it's my responsibility to assess your taste
in food, no matter how disastrous it is.

197
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:40,517
But Yachi, what are you talking about?

198
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,077
You love that kind of stuff.

199
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:44,677
And you're always sneaking
snacks and sweets, silly.

200
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:46,997
Hey, guys, I think we should, uh...

201
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,360
Let's raise a toast!

202
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:50,920
Yeah, everyone grab a glass.

203
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,840
Oh, that's right.

204
00:15:56,500 --> 00:15:58,500
You are the star this time around.

205
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:02,820
You should give a speech. Huh?
Me? Give the speech? Mm-hmm.

206
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,880
Uh, okay then, uh...

207
00:16:08,700 --> 00:16:12,457
I want to thank each and every
one of you for coming to save me.

208
00:16:12,540 --> 00:16:13,757
It's something I'll never...

209
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,080
Time's up! Kanpai!

210
00:16:16,060 --> 00:16:16,890
Kanpai!

211
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,880
Now what should I eat first?

212
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:25,561
I mean, yeah, I can do it myself.

213
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:27,317
My food is Yuki's cooking.

214
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,260
It's the best!

215
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:31,317
Yeah, and they get to help out a lot, too.

216
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:34,820
Are you absolutely sure I
can't have Yuki? Shut up.

217
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,120
Um, guys?

218
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,614
That reminds me, Yuki.

219
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:43,837
We forgot to tell you something
while we were in the hospital.

220
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,580
Welcome home, Yuki.

221
00:16:51,420 --> 00:16:52,760
Glad to be here.

222
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:00,820
Big sis.

223
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:04,160
That's an easy one.

224
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,510
Huh?

225
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:09,200
I just have to become Supreme Commander.

226
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:13,980
I'll change the Demon
Defense Forces policies.

227
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:16,240
I'll exterminate the Shuki,

228
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:20,257
protect Aoba and her friends,
and then find a way to cure them.

229
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:21,516
How does that sound?

230
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:27,060
In that case, we might finally
get to rest easy. Big Sis!

231
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,960
An earthquake!

232
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:32,000
The cave's collapsing!

233
00:17:32,180 --> 00:17:34,280
We need to leave now! Got it!

234
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:37,224
Let's get to the exit together!

235
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:40,920
Big Sis!

236
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:47,960
Fix that for me.

237
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,350
Huh?

238
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:51,360
Hold on!

239
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:54,260
It's alright.

240
00:17:54,740 --> 00:17:56,269
I'll be watching over you.

241
00:17:58,220 --> 00:17:59,340
Time's running out.

242
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:01,600
Yuki! I swear!

243
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:03,677
I will find a way to help you!

244
00:18:03,760 --> 00:18:05,740
I will always fight for you!

245
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:08,880
You've gotten so strong!

246
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:10,140
You get an A+.

247
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:13,890
Thanks!

248
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:24,020
Up till now, I've been fighting
because I wanted to be a hero.

249
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:28,020
But now I have a much
more important purpose.

250
00:18:28,300 --> 00:18:30,020
To cure my big sister.

251
00:18:30,380 --> 00:18:32,145
That's my reason for fighting.

252
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:43,420
Good morning.

253
00:18:44,060 --> 00:18:44,890
Tenka?

254
00:18:44,973 --> 00:18:46,840
What are you doing in my room?

255
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:51,300
I told you to nigh that I expected a
generous reward when we were alone.

256
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:55,500
I was admiring your adorable
face while you slept.

257
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:56,870
Yuki!

258
00:18:56,953 --> 00:18:58,915
How long are you going to stay in bed?

259
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,230
Uh...

260
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:08,448
Seriously, given your recent absence,
don't you have paperwork to catch up on?

261
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:09,698
All right, you are.

262
00:19:12,520 --> 00:19:15,520
We'll get back to this at
a later date, okay, Yuki?

263
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,070
Honestly.

264
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:19,400
What? No!

265
00:19:20,060 --> 00:19:22,942
Tenka was just dropping
by to say hello, I swear!

266
00:19:24,860 --> 00:19:27,440
That honestly was meant for you! Huh?

267
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:31,537
Evidently, you still don't
understand who your master is.

268
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:32,757
You need discipline.

269
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,080
Brace yourself.

270
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:44,880
Why are you already tired
when I just called you?

271
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:48,060
Sorry, Miss Kyoka really
put me through the ringer.

272
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:49,290
Oh?

273
00:19:49,373 --> 00:19:50,203
Extra training?

274
00:19:50,286 --> 00:19:51,417
Sounds like something she'd do.

275
00:19:51,500 --> 00:19:53,157
What did you want to talk to me about?

276
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:55,416
I want to hone my Peach ability, too.

277
00:19:56,100 --> 00:19:57,571
You mean learning, right?

278
00:19:57,780 --> 00:20:00,074
I want to be an asset to the Commander.

279
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,600
I need to get stronger.

280
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:06,880
Which is why I need your help, Yuki.

281
00:20:09,020 --> 00:20:09,850
Sure.

282
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,420
Be patient, Shushu.

283
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:16,268
Now is not the time to act.

284
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:20,397
Remember what you uncovered on the
internet during the hospital stay.

285
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:22,980
The art of war applies to romance, too!

286
00:20:23,580 --> 00:20:26,639
Instead of vying for
attention, I need to act aloof.

287
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:30,817
According to my analysis, Yuki's
love levels look something like this.

288
00:20:30,900 --> 00:20:33,620
If I don't use my brain,
I can't win the game!

289
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:36,380
It is all exactly as I envisioned it.

290
00:20:36,780 --> 00:20:38,140
What is she doing?

291
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:43,700
Hey guys, a gateway just opened up!

292
00:20:44,020 --> 00:20:45,580
Get ready for battle!

293
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:48,515
What's the situation?

294
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:52,577
Currently, I'm not detecting anyone
in need of rescue near the gateway.

295
00:20:52,660 --> 00:20:55,248
However, more and more
Shuki are converging.

296
00:20:55,620 --> 00:20:57,100
Then we'd better hurry!

297
00:20:57,300 --> 00:20:59,217
We're all counting on you, got it?

298
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:00,200
Roger!

299
00:21:05,040 --> 00:21:07,260
Alright, let's get...

300
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:10,500
Let's get moving, Commander.

301
00:21:17,020 --> 00:21:18,980
Faster, Yugi! Right!

302
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:25,820
Kaboom!

303
00:21:32,620 --> 00:21:34,040
Now! Got it!

304
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:36,740
It's time to fall down!

305
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:40,177
This is how I became...

306
00:21:40,260 --> 00:21:41,520
This is the story.

307
00:21:41,860 --> 00:21:43,160
Supreme Commander!

308
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:45,780
Of how I became a hero!

309
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,510
Coco.

310
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:55,290
Noon.

311
00:21:55,760 --> 00:21:58,580
I swear on my life I will find you.

312
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:12,600
Thank you.

313
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:43,030
Let's go.

314
00:22:59,300 --> 00:23:00,130
It is your body.

315
00:23:00,213 --> 00:23:02,977
Your heart, when it story?

316
00:23:03,060 --> 00:23:03,890
Your heart will be right.

317
00:23:03,973 --> 00:23:05,157
My heart will behave.

318
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:09,497
You know.

319
00:23:09,580 --> 00:23:14,200
Your heart will be right.

320
00:23:15,300 --> 00:23:17,557
You know.

321
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:19,337
You'll hear it?

322
00:23:19,420 --> 00:23:23,717
I'll see you

323
00:23:23,800 --> 00:23:29,320
next time.
